{'symbol': 'TTWO', 'date': '2021-09-14 09:45:00', 'title': 'TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. ANNOUNCES RESULTS OF ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. (NASDAQ: TTWO) (THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED THE RESULTS OF THE STOCKHOLDER VOTE AT ITS ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS HELD TODAY. THE FOLLOWING DIRECTORS WERE ELECTED: STRAUSS ZELNICK, CHAIRMAN; MICHAEL DORNEMANN; ROLAND HERNANDEZ; J MOSES; MICHAEL SHERESKY; LAVERNE SRINIVASAN; SUSAN TOLSON; PAUL VIERA. IN ADDITION, THE COMPANY'S STOCKHOLDERS: APPROVED, ON A NON-BINDING ADVISORY BASIS, THE COMPENSATION OF THE COMPANY'S “NAMED EXECUTIVE"}